  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to humanitarian needs assessment in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project intend to support Caritas Zimbabwe in conducting needs assessment to decide upon the future course of action in terms of food insecurity, support to education and promoting preventive health as well as hygiene and environmental sanitation. Four diocesan teams will be lead by an external consultant to collect and collate data which will be used in developing new programme proposal.</narrative>
  </description>
